{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104677","id":2420926782,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6QTGk-","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104677","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104677.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104677.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104677","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104677/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104677/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104677/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/943bec398f74fa8d08a88e12813863d9d013b113","number":104677,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix applying `TileMapLayer.self_modulate` to tiles","user":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #104665.\r\n\r\nTileMapLayer's `self_modulate` was being applied:\r\n- for each tile drawing command,\r\n- for each quadrants' canvas item (used for drawing tiles), but only on specific rendering changes (not when creating such canvas items):\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/594d64ec244b6b99321e2096987d4d69de4c8845/scene/2d/tile_map_layer.cpp#L376-L390\r\n\r\n#104665 revealed the bug because the specific steps to reproduce resulted in changes to `self_modulate` updating only the quadrants' canvas items' `self_modulate`. The tile drawing commands were not being reissued (as not needed / nothing changed), hence they were still using old `self_modulate` when such draw commands were issued (specifically `0.0`, hence tiles ended up invisible).\r\n\r\nThis PR removes modulation argument from `TileMapLayer::draw_tile` as not needed / unused, `self_modulate` is now applied only per quadrants' canvas items (including on creation).","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8089024095,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAAB4iS2Xw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/cherrypick:4.4","name":"cherrypick:4.4","description":"Considered for cherry-picking into a future 4.4.x release","color":"446699","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id"